  "premise_review": [
    "SafeRelPath has value:String plus all four actual constraints: value≠empty, no exact dotdot component in splitOn slash, negated startsWith slash test, and every split component nonempty. All binders and original types are copied unchanged.",
    "Both theorems retain the whole p:SafeRelPath and exact conclusions/projection proof terms. No constraint is dropped or turned into a weaker type. The component stays whole because the proofs depend directly on that complete record.",
    "Only literal string tests are specified. No symlink resolution, OS separator handling, dot normalization, traversal containment, file existence, filesystem operation, security acceptance or path canonicalization is inferred.",
    "The original Folder.Basic import is unchanged and its whole332B provider body is import Mathlib plus documentation. It does not declare Folder, so the new component adds no open Folder or invented alias. All original source notices remain exact."
  ],
